      "text": "["
    },
    {
      "speaker": 5,
      "start": 37.44,
      "end": 38.47,
      "text": "from recipe"
    },
    {
      "speaker": 5,
      "start": 38.82,
      "end": 39.6,
      "text": "Okay, so..."
    },
    {
      "speaker": 6,
      "start": 40.32,
      "end": 45.41,
      "text": "a full house of eight synthetic open voices, let\u0027s put nimitron 3-dirization to the test."
    },
    {
      "speaker": 0,
      "start": 45.91,
      "end": 53.18,
      "text": "Okay, so the new diorization model can tag each of our voices as it transcribes, but can it do that while we all speak together? Let\u0027s find out."
    },
    {
      "speaker": 3,
      "start": 53.86,
      "end": 55.62,
      "text": "Even when two of us pocketed one."
    },
    {
      "speaker": 4,
      "start": 54.28,
      "end": 57.35,
      "text": "Don\u0027t name both of us, even while we speak over each other."
    },
    {
      "speaker": 2,
      "start": 57.3,
      "end": 60.67,
      "text": "frame by frame, it labels who spoke when."
    },
    {
      "speaker": 0,
      "start": 61.27,
      "end": 66.97,
      "text": "Amazing. We can all talk at the same time, and Nemotron 3 diorization still separates every speaker."
    },
    {
      "speaker": 4,
      "start": 67.67,
      "end": 68.74,
      "text": "Die is the king of the"
    },
    {
      "speaker": 3,
      "start": 67.68,
      "end": 69.63,
      "text": "Dies like a female speaking for it once."
    },
    {
      "speaker": 1,
      "start": 68.08,
      "end": 68.86,
      "text": "Get on me!"
    },
    {
      "speaker": 2,
      "start": 68.4,
      "end": 69.12,
      "text": "We\u0027re not being"
    },
    {
      "speaker": 0,
      "start": 70.54,
      "end": 76.65,
      "text": "Okay, so even the old Nemo sort-former model could capture four, but eight? Now that\u0027s hard. Everyone, all together, go."
    },
    {
      "speaker": 0,
      "start": 76.97,
      "end": 78.19,
      "text": "Here we go."
    },
    {
      "speaker": 1,
